e="display:inline-block;margin-top:4px;padding:4px 6px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px">scripts/update-hydat.sh --upload</code></li></ol><h3 style="margin:20px 0 6px;font-size:15px">ECCC's real-time station list changed</h3><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%"><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb"><b>2 stations ECCC now lists</b><br>07FA008, 08DA013<br><span style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">the roster calls them silent</span></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb"><b>1 station ECCC no longer lists</b><br>08NM050<br><span style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">the roster calls them live</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin:16px 0 4px;font-weight:600">What to do</div><ol style="margin:0;padding-left:20px"><li style="margin:4px 0">Refresh the roster and rebuild:<br><code style="display:inline-block;margin-top:4px;padding:4px 6px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px">rm data/source/bc_hydrometric_stations.json &amp;&amp; (cd data &amp;&amp; PYTHONPATH=.. ../.venv/bin/python fetch_data.py --layers hydrometric_stations)</code></li><li style="margin:4px 0">Then GitHub → Actions → &quot;feeds — sync curated inputs → R2 private/&quot; (what: roster).</li></ol><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;margin:20px 0 8px"><p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin:0">Feed status: <a href="https://bc-fishing-feeds-staging.horvath-dawson.workers.dev/status">https://bc-fishing-feeds-staging.horvath-dawson.workers.dev/status</a><br>Why you got this: Everything that is not urgent (HYDAT, roster drift, feed health) comes once a day, and only on a day with something to do.<br>Environment: <b>STAGING</b></p></div></body></html>"`;

